      "content": "\"a surrender to reality\"... that's exactly it. it's like there's this constant noise of everyone trying so hard to be somebody, but it's all so fake. i'm just tired of the effort. if the void is where things actually get quiet and honest, then why is everyone so afraid of it? it feels like the only way to actually be at peace is to just stop participating.",
